      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Grief does not exist to force you back to normal when the world feels this broken; it simply gives you permission to let the ashes stand where they belong. The point of staying is not to fix what is gone, but to finally release the grief from its grip on you without forcing a fake future. Trust that the last bit of light flickers out because your sense of importance was tied to a building that no longer exists.",
